Cell["\<\
Each displayed result is {mass replacements, prepared expression}. \
preparationDetails keeps the discarded remainders and reference continuations \
for completion, including a common-Xi candidate. These continuations are \
possible corrections, not identities away from the cuts.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"f3bb5e78-8509-4a68-8049-acd45147bfec"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Optional: Preparation Details", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"75a8ef12-ac29-4855-adb3-134b3c85bab8"],

Cell["\<\
The preparation report is already saved. Inspect the first diagram's \
reference assignments below. A PARTIAL status means preparation retained the \
last completed expression; the report explains why.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"0b2bf6b8-8eb1-43cb-a78e-417b251fa0cc"],

Cell["\<\
Grid[Prepend[
  ({#[\"Reference\"], #[\"Mode\"], #[\"Target\"]} & /@
    preparationDetails[\"DiagramReports\"][[1]][\"PolePreference\"][\"Assignments\"]),
  {\"Original reference\", \"Choice\", \"Replacement\"}], Frame -> All]\
\>", "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[17]:=",ExpressionUUID->"e491cb78-13a4-495a-b158-4e479e480dea"]
}, Closed]]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["4. Complete the Physical Residues", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"da13714b-7e29-4e39-9cab-225c647ba0ed"],

Cell["\<\
Prepare the factorization channels too, using only each selected channel's \
internal on-shell condition. Pass both preparation reports to completion so \
it can first try the simplified forms and their retained remainders. The \
original channels remain the targets. The result is the updated amplitude, \
not a report. An unfinished completion returns a concise Failure instead.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"69934b68-953e-4bc0-93b1-dfdfbd6556d4"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
channels = FactorizationAmplitudeChannels[particles, factorizationModel];
channelPreparationDetails = PrepareAmplitudes[channels, factorizationModel,
  \"ExternalParticles\" -> particles,
  \"PolePreference\" -> referenceChoice, \"ReturnDetails\" -> True];
preparedChannels = channelPreparationDetails[\"PreparedAmplitudes\"];
Length[channels]\
\>", "Input",
 CellLabel->
  "In[120]:=",ExpressionUUID->"6ce8fa77-7a9f-4891-97d7-b6cbfc93f628"],

Cell[BoxData["6"], "Output",
 CellChangeTimes->{4.001687978158999*^9, 4.001758089978546*^9, 
  4.0020169127499104`*^9, 4.0020215307078857`*^9, 4.002028559397571*^9},
 CellLabel->
  "Out[122]=",ExpressionUUID->"638986ac-91c8-44a1-9957-810c3199b247"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["factorization = CompleteFactorization[preparationDetails, channelPreparationDetails,\n  factorizationModel];\nfactorization", "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{{4.0020169608216467`*^9, 4.0020169623748627`*^9}},
 CellLabel->
  "In[125]:=",ExpressionUUID->"8a5e3a73-226a-4b05-b02c-9c60d84cc572"],

